                "description": "The Omnia 36 Chic Leverset with Round Rose is a really sleek lever that is a true classic. Some door hardware goes in and out of style, but this leverset has been a popular choice for many years and will continue to be so due to its modern design. It's a favorite for modern decor lovers. The Modern Chic Lever with Round Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
